  "description": "Riding fun meets comfort meets versatility. Whether it’s a sporty afterwork ride in the woods, your daily commute or a multi-day tour with luggage – our TREKKING 7 can do it all. This premium trekking eBike will impress you with its versatility, sense of adventure and high level of comfort. The powerful Bosch Performance CX motor provides strong support whenever you need it. With the 800Wh battery and the optional Range Extender, even full-day tours are no problem. The 100mm SR Suntour suspension fork ensures you’re well-equipped for moderate off-road rides, and the adjustable stem allows you to fine-tune your riding position. Plus, with StVZO features like mudguards, a rear rack and lighting, this eBike is fully road-compliant. Available in both high and low-frame versions. Perfect for those who value fun, comfort and versatility on every ride.",
